bind File Patent Application: Application ID, Application Fee
bind Conduct Patent Search: Application ID, Application Fee, Search Result
bind Examine Patent Application: Application ID, Application Fee, Application Status, Search Result
bind Grant Patent: Application ID, Application Fee, Decision
bind Reject Patent Application: Application ID, Application Fee, Application Status, Decision
bind File Trademark Application: Application ID, Application Fee
bind Conduct Trademark Search: Application ID, Application Fee, Search Result
